        "note_tweet": {
          "entities": {},
          "text": "其实日雌确实并不是一个非常科学的HRT方案。最理想的EV injection monotherapy是~5天~5mg左右，日雌一个ampule瓶10mg，峰谷值相差太大了。\n日雌的优点在于价格还算便宜，相对方便（一周一次不用每天吃药），但它的代谢周期和用量一直算是个比较尴尬的位置。\n我的建议是如果当前的肝功肾功和六项都没问题的话就不要换药，没有必要。\n\nActually, progynon depot is indeed not a very scientific HRT regimen. The ideal EV injection monotherapy is around ~5mg / ~5 days. One ampule is 10mg, making the peak trough gap is too large.\nThe advantages are that, it's relatively cheap, convenient (once a week, no need to take daily), but its metabolic cycle and dosage have always been in a rather awkward position.\nMy suggestion is if your current liver function, kidney function, and hormone level are all fine, theres no need to switch medications."
        },
